WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.740
- In 1812, Ephraim Thayer
and Hannah Taft gave birth

00:00:02.740 --> 00:00:04.420
to a daughter and named her Bathsheba.

00:00:04.420 --> 00:00:05.280
Born in Rhode Island,

00:00:05.280 --> 00:00:06.650
Bathsheba would spend her life living

00:00:06.650 --> 00:00:07.890
in the Northeast United States,

00:00:07.890 --> 00:00:09.580
eventually finding herself in Connecticut,

00:00:09.580 --> 00:00:11.500
where she would meet a
man named Judson Sherman.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:14.220
The two began to date
and on March 10th, 1844,

00:00:14.220 --> 00:00:16.110
they were married and
she moved on to his farm.

00:00:16.110 --> 00:00:18.970
In 1851, Bathsheba had
a son, Herbert Sherman,

00:00:18.970 --> 00:00:20.010
her only offspring,

00:00:20.010 --> 00:00:22.160
at least as far as the public record goes.

00:00:22.160 --> 00:00:23.480
It is believed that she gave birth

00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:26.070
to an additional three children,
two more boys and a girl,

00:00:26.070 --> 00:00:28.230
but none of them lived long
enough to ever be reflected

00:00:28.230 --> 00:00:29.150
in census data.

00:00:29.150 --> 00:00:31.530
Although there were rumors
of Bathsheba being involved

00:00:31.530 --> 00:00:33.660
in witchcraft and ritualistic sacrifices

00:00:33.660 --> 00:00:35.130
after an infant in her care died

00:00:35.130 --> 00:00:37.240
after supposedly being
impaled with a sewing needle,

00:00:37.240 --> 00:00:40.100
there was never any proof
and it was the 1800s.

00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:42.150
Modern medical science
couldn't be depended upon

00:00:42.150 --> 00:00:43.300
to save a sick child.

00:00:43.300 --> 00:00:45.470
So Herbert was her only
kin to outlive her.

00:00:45.470 --> 00:00:47.150
She carried on until 1885,

00:00:47.150 --> 00:00:48.650
when she went into a bout of paralysis

00:00:48.650 --> 00:00:50.410
that doctors at the
time could not identify

00:00:50.410 --> 00:00:51.440
and never recovered,

00:00:51.440 --> 00:00:53.520
dying at the age of 73 years old.

00:00:53.520 --> 00:00:54.950
We can now infer that this incident

00:00:54.950 --> 00:00:56.720
was possibly related to a stroke.

00:00:56.720 --> 00:00:58.050
And that's basically the life

00:00:58.050 --> 00:00:59.580
of the real Bathsheba Sherman.

00:00:59.580 --> 00:01:01.850
However, "The Conjuring"
character, Bathsheba Sherman,

00:01:01.850 --> 00:01:03.510
met a much darker fate.

00:01:03.510 --> 00:01:05.740
To learn how additional
context of Bathsheba's life

00:01:05.740 --> 00:01:07.210
shaped the malevolent witch's spirit

00:01:07.210 --> 00:01:08.340
seen in The Conjuring,

00:01:08.340 --> 00:01:10.670
and how the character may
have influenced later events,

00:01:10.670 --> 00:01:12.944
stick around to the end of this video.

00:01:12.944 --> 00:01:15.777
(electric guitar)

00:01:18.520 --> 00:01:20.040
Welcome to Horror History.

00:01:20.040 --> 00:01:22.060
Most Conjuring movies,
as you would expect,

00:01:22.060 --> 00:01:23.680
deal with the conjuring of demons.

00:01:23.680 --> 00:01:25.400
Much of the lore is based on the grimoire,

00:01:25.400 --> 00:01:26.540
The Lesser Key of Solomon,

00:01:26.540 --> 00:01:29.230
which details evil entities
like Malthus and Valak.

00:01:29.230 --> 00:01:31.440
The demon attached to
Isla in The Conjuring 3

00:01:31.440 --> 00:01:33.320
similarly has occult origins.

00:01:33.320 --> 00:01:35.400
There are, however,
Conjurverse antagonists

00:01:35.400 --> 00:01:37.490
who are based more on local urban legends.

00:01:37.490 --> 00:01:39.220
The second is the legend of La Llorona,

00:01:39.220 --> 00:01:41.000
a ghost from Latin American folklore,

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:43.030
but the original is Bathsheba the witch,

00:01:43.030 --> 00:01:45.260
who was based on the mysterious
New England farm wife

00:01:45.260 --> 00:01:47.300
that supposedly haunts
the old Arnold estate

00:01:47.300 --> 00:01:48.620
in Harrisville, Rhode Island.

00:01:48.620 --> 00:01:49.940
As always in Horror History,

00:01:49.940 --> 00:01:51.270
I'll be analyzing the timeline,

00:01:51.270 --> 00:01:52.370
but the timeline of the events

00:01:52.370 --> 00:01:54.240
of the real Bathsheba
Sherman, don't match up

00:01:54.240 --> 00:01:56.310
with the timeline of the
movie character, Bathsheba,

00:01:56.310 --> 00:01:58.310
who died seven days after
the birth of her child.

00:01:58.310 --> 00:01:59.880
So, I'm going to start with one event

00:01:59.880 --> 00:02:01.330
that is in both timelines,

00:02:01.330 --> 00:02:03.970
the marriage of Bathsheba
Thayer and Judson Sherman.

00:02:03.970 --> 00:02:05.500
I'll sort all this out on the other side

00:02:05.500 --> 00:02:06.686
of the Horror History screen.

00:02:06.686 --> 00:02:10.769
(pages flipping and eerie music)

00:02:11.930 --> 00:02:14.720
In real life, Bathsheba's
marriage came in 1844,

00:02:14.720 --> 00:02:16.700
when she was 31 or 32 years old.

00:02:16.700 --> 00:02:18.010
In The Conjuring, Lorraine claims

00:02:18.010 --> 00:02:20.984
that the farmhouse was built
in 1863 by Judson Sherman.

00:02:20.984 --> 00:02:22.230
And the way she says it

00:02:22.230 --> 00:02:24.050
makes it seem like Judson
was married to Bathsheba

00:02:24.050 --> 00:02:25.080
at the time it was built.

00:02:25.080 --> 00:02:27.640
I'm assuming this was very
shortly after their marriage.

00:02:27.640 --> 00:02:29.100
Typically, a couple moves in together

00:02:29.100 --> 00:02:30.270
immediately after marriage,

00:02:30.270 --> 00:02:32.100
so I'm just going to
call it the same year.

00:02:32.100 --> 00:02:34.610
Assuming her major life
events came at similar ages,

00:02:34.610 --> 00:02:36.600
that means movie Bathsheba
would have been born

00:02:36.600 --> 00:02:39.300
in about 1831, married in 1863,

00:02:39.300 --> 00:02:40.990
and had the baby in 1870,

00:02:40.990 --> 00:02:43.440
which leaves a pretty big gap
between marriage and baby.

00:02:43.440 --> 00:02:45.690
Lorraine's research mentions
that Bathsheba was caught

00:02:45.690 --> 00:02:48.260
by her husband, sacrificing
the seven day old child.

00:02:48.260 --> 00:02:49.720
But she never says with certainty that

00:02:49.720 --> 00:02:51.270
that was her first child.

00:02:51.270 --> 00:02:53.650
I mentioned the real life
Bathsheba being associated

00:02:53.650 --> 00:02:55.930
with rumors of other
children having died young

00:02:55.930 --> 00:02:58.200
and thus, being excluded
from the public record.

00:02:58.200 --> 00:02:59.990
And I think the movie
leaves open this possibility

00:02:59.990 --> 00:03:01.490
based on the events that play out.

00:03:01.490 --> 00:03:04.080
Remember, when Carolyn is
possessed by Bathsheba's spirit,

00:03:04.080 --> 00:03:05.940
she's not just targeting one daughter.

00:03:05.940 --> 00:03:08.190
She starts by going after
the middle girl, Christine.

00:03:08.190 --> 00:03:09.480
It's only after that doesn't work

00:03:09.480 --> 00:03:11.290
that she tries to get April, the youngest.

00:03:11.290 --> 00:03:13.130
In the movie, Bathsheba's
ties to witchcraft

00:03:13.130 --> 00:03:14.480
are explained by her lineage.

00:03:14.480 --> 00:03:16.540
It's stated that she's
related to Mary Towne Eastey,

00:03:16.540 --> 00:03:17.660
who was accused of witchcraft

00:03:17.660 --> 00:03:19.380
and hung during the Salem witch trials.

00:03:19.380 --> 00:03:21.130
She is also based off of a real person

00:03:21.130 --> 00:03:22.560
who lives 200 years earlier.

00:03:22.560 --> 00:03:24.240
The reason for these witch sacrifices,

00:03:24.240 --> 00:03:26.590
according to Lorraine,
all ties into Satanism.

00:03:26.590 --> 00:03:28.520
They believed that they
were elevating their status

00:03:28.520 --> 00:03:29.450
in the eyes of Satan.

00:03:29.450 --> 00:03:32.410
After Bathsheba, or can
I just nickname her Bath?

00:03:32.410 --> 00:03:34.390
After Bath was caught
sacrificing her baby,

00:03:34.390 --> 00:03:35.890
she proclaimed her love to Satan

00:03:35.890 --> 00:03:37.930
and cursed anyone who
would try to take her land

00:03:37.930 --> 00:03:39.580
and hung herself in the tree outside.

00:03:39.580 --> 00:03:42.010
But as we know, the
story doesn't end there.

00:03:42.010 --> 00:03:43.570
We're given bits and
pieces of the hauntings

00:03:43.570 --> 00:03:44.960
that would occur from that point forward

00:03:44.960 --> 00:03:46.240
and if we put them all together,

00:03:46.240 --> 00:03:47.470
there's a common theme.

00:03:47.470 --> 00:03:49.680
In the 1930s, a woman named Mrs. Walker

00:03:49.680 --> 00:03:50.940
lived there with her son, Rory.

00:03:50.940 --> 00:03:51.960
According to the papers,

00:03:51.960 --> 00:03:53.980
Rory mysteriously
disappeared in the woods,

00:03:53.980 --> 00:03:56.010
but Lorraine's visions
tell a different story,

00:03:56.010 --> 00:03:58.100
where she can be seen
stabbing her son in the cellar

00:03:58.100 --> 00:04:00.260
before taking herself out
of the picture as well.

00:04:00.260 --> 00:04:03.533
However, a sad final outcry
helps explain her behavior.

00:04:05.681 --> 00:04:08.620
- [Mrs. Walker] She made me do it

00:04:08.620 --> 00:04:10.960
- [Zac] Mrs. Walker was
possessed to commit her crime

00:04:10.960 --> 00:04:12.350
by the ghost of Bathsheba.

00:04:12.350 --> 00:04:14.220
Other ghosts that we've seen
in The Conjuring franchise

00:04:14.220 --> 00:04:16.800
don't have the power to take
over somebody's body like this.

00:04:16.800 --> 00:04:18.400
We've seen it many times with demons,

00:04:18.400 --> 00:04:20.810
but only this once from
the ghost of a witch.

00:04:20.810 --> 00:04:23.120
Since her sacrifice was
done in the name of Satan,

00:04:23.120 --> 00:04:25.870
it seems like Bath has gained
some of this demonic power.

00:04:25.870 --> 00:04:27.330
Her final proclamation in life,

00:04:27.330 --> 00:04:29.150
cursed anyone who would
try to take her land.

00:04:29.150 --> 00:04:30.960
So when the farmhouse
was eventually split up

00:04:30.960 --> 00:04:32.040
into multiple properties,

00:04:32.040 --> 00:04:33.900
there were even more victims
for her to come after.

00:04:33.900 --> 00:04:36.260
Like the Bledsoe boy, who
drowned in a pond accident

00:04:36.260 --> 00:04:37.720
and the maid in a neighboring home

00:04:37.720 --> 00:04:38.830
who slit her wrists.

00:04:38.830 --> 00:04:39.900
The maid's ghost would echo

00:04:39.900 --> 00:04:42.536
almost the same line as Mrs. Walker.

00:04:42.536 --> 00:04:44.938
- [MAID] Look what she made me do.

00:04:44.938 --> 00:04:46.490
Look what she made me do!

00:04:46.490 --> 00:04:47.860
- While not much is known about this,

00:04:47.860 --> 00:04:50.190
there was also a tragic
school bus accident

00:04:50.190 --> 00:04:51.600
that perhaps took place on the property

00:04:51.600 --> 00:04:53.350
and claimed the lives
of four more children.

00:04:53.350 --> 00:04:55.387
It seems unlikely that there
would be a fatal accident

00:04:55.387 --> 00:04:56.990
in rural Rhode Island,

00:04:56.990 --> 00:04:59.070
so I imagined the bus
driver, like the others,

00:04:59.070 --> 00:05:01.090
was not in control of his or her own body

00:05:01.090 --> 00:05:03.310
at the time the so-called
accident occurred.

00:05:03.310 --> 00:05:04.930
There's one constant that runs through

00:05:04.930 --> 00:05:06.090
most of these tragedies.

00:05:06.090 --> 00:05:08.510
And it helps explain part
of Bathsheba's motivation.

00:05:08.510 --> 00:05:10.000
Each of these accidents involves

00:05:10.000 --> 00:05:11.750
the premature passing of a child.

00:05:11.750 --> 00:05:13.240
It would seem that the witch's undertaking

00:05:13.240 --> 00:05:14.770
does not expire in death.

00:05:14.770 --> 00:05:16.680
The only exception to
this seems to be the maid,

00:05:16.680 --> 00:05:18.990
who looks like a young
adult, though it's possible

00:05:18.990 --> 00:05:20.370
that there's another child disappearance

00:05:20.370 --> 00:05:22.280
that just doesn't come up
in the Warrens' research.

00:05:22.280 --> 00:05:25.540
If each kid sacrificed moves
Bathsheba up in Satan's ranks,

00:05:25.540 --> 00:05:28.960
it's no wonder that there was
a huge opportunity in 1971,

00:05:28.960 --> 00:05:29.950
when the Perron family,

00:05:29.950 --> 00:05:31.090
with their five daughters,

00:05:31.090 --> 00:05:33.263
first moved into the Old Arnold Estate.

00:05:37.600 --> 00:05:39.267
- [Roger] Here we are.

00:05:43.563 --> 00:05:47.370
(slow nostalgic music)

00:05:47.370 --> 00:05:49.120
- It was fall of 1971

00:05:49.120 --> 00:05:51.040
when Roger Perron purchased the farmhouse

00:05:51.040 --> 00:05:52.350
in an auction from the bank.

00:05:52.350 --> 00:05:53.970
However, despite Bathsheba's claim

00:05:53.970 --> 00:05:55.040
that she would curse anyone

00:05:55.040 --> 00:05:56.170
who tried to take her land,

00:05:56.170 --> 00:05:58.550
Roger was not main object of her wrath.

00:05:58.550 --> 00:05:59.840
Instead it was his wife,

00:05:59.840 --> 00:06:01.380
Carolyn who suffered the most.

00:06:01.380 --> 00:06:02.550
After spending the first night there,

00:06:02.550 --> 00:06:03.750
she awakens with bruises

00:06:03.750 --> 00:06:05.860
after breaking in the new
house with her husband.

00:06:05.860 --> 00:06:07.060
If you know what I mean.

00:06:07.060 --> 00:06:09.490
This was a new take on the
stories written by Andrea Perron

00:06:09.490 --> 00:06:11.110
about her family's time in the house.

00:06:11.110 --> 00:06:13.560
In her trilogy of books, "House
of Darkness House of Light",

00:06:13.560 --> 00:06:15.180
she explains that she feels Bathsheba

00:06:15.180 --> 00:06:16.770
despised Carolyn in particular,

00:06:16.770 --> 00:06:18.480
because she saw her as
essentially taking over

00:06:18.480 --> 00:06:19.520
the mother figure in the house

00:06:19.520 --> 00:06:20.763
and Bath was jealous.

00:06:21.630 --> 00:06:23.270
- My mother was never allowed

00:06:23.270 --> 00:06:25.410
to assume her rightful position

00:06:25.410 --> 00:06:26.770
as mistress of the house.

00:06:26.770 --> 00:06:30.400
That's the bottom line,
whatever the spirit was

00:06:30.400 --> 00:06:34.550
that taunted and haunted my mother

00:06:34.550 --> 00:06:38.023
so supremely over a decade,

00:06:39.050 --> 00:06:41.810
was not willing to
relinquish the position.

00:06:41.810 --> 00:06:43.610
She loathed my mother.

00:06:43.610 --> 00:06:46.300
She lusted after my father, lusted.

00:06:46.300 --> 00:06:48.010
I use that word deliberately.

00:06:48.010 --> 00:06:49.230
- [ZAC] In the books, Andrea claims

00:06:49.230 --> 00:06:50.660
that her mother was stabbed in the leg

00:06:50.660 --> 00:06:52.040
by the spirit with a sewing needle,

00:06:52.040 --> 00:06:53.010
which is the same weapon

00:06:53.010 --> 00:06:55.270
supposedly found lodged in
the skull of that infant

00:06:55.270 --> 00:06:56.940
that died under Bathsheba's care.

00:06:56.940 --> 00:06:58.570
The fictional family also encountered

00:06:58.570 --> 00:07:00.160
a rancid smell moving around the house,

00:07:00.160 --> 00:07:02.390
and Bathsheba even went
after the family dog.

00:07:02.390 --> 00:07:05.340
Each paranormal instance
would often began at 3:07 AM,

00:07:05.340 --> 00:07:07.470
the official time of death
of Bathsheba Sherman.

00:07:07.470 --> 00:07:09.310
This would continue onto the second night

00:07:09.310 --> 00:07:11.300
where the evil witch
pulled on Christine's ankle

00:07:11.300 --> 00:07:12.900
as she slept, to terrorize her.

00:07:12.900 --> 00:07:14.392
It seems that Bathsheba
also has the ability

00:07:14.392 --> 00:07:16.110
to mess with the TV signal

00:07:16.110 --> 00:07:18.190
and distracts Roger with
a series of three knocks

00:07:18.190 --> 00:07:19.790
that send him searching around the house.

00:07:19.790 --> 00:07:21.450
There may be more than one meaning here.

00:07:21.450 --> 00:07:23.840
The activity towards Roger
never seems malicious,

00:07:23.840 --> 00:07:25.610
unlike what happens to
his wife and daughters.

00:07:25.610 --> 00:07:27.090
So this could be interpreted as Bath

00:07:27.090 --> 00:07:28.040
trying to play with him,

00:07:28.040 --> 00:07:29.970
to kind of assume that matriarchal role.

00:07:29.970 --> 00:07:31.870
Then there's the fact that
the knocking comes in threes

00:07:31.870 --> 00:07:33.973
which Ed Warren has his own theory about.

00:07:35.160 --> 00:07:38.433
- Sometimes it's meant as
an insult to the Trinity,

00:07:38.433 --> 00:07:40.100
the father, the son, and the holy spirit.

00:07:40.100 --> 00:07:42.570
- If she's trying to make a
mockery of a religious concept,

00:07:42.570 --> 00:07:44.650
this may not actually
be the first example.

00:07:44.650 --> 00:07:46.610
Just look at her name, Bathsheba.

00:07:46.610 --> 00:07:49.410
Bathsheba was the biblical wife
of King David in the Torah.

00:07:49.410 --> 00:07:51.010
I've been calling her
Bath this whole time,

00:07:51.010 --> 00:07:53.060
but maybe I was focusing on
the wrong part of her name

00:07:53.060 --> 00:07:54.740
and should have been calling her Sheba.

00:07:54.740 --> 00:07:57.280
This in itself could be a
mockery of the queen of Sheba

00:07:57.280 --> 00:07:58.330
from the Hebrew Bible.

00:07:58.330 --> 00:08:01.120
And yes, obviously a
baby doesn't name itself,

00:08:01.120 --> 00:08:01.953
as far as I know,

00:08:01.953 --> 00:08:03.850
but remember, Bathsheba's
ties to witchcraft

00:08:03.850 --> 00:08:05.430
are said to be passed down by her family.

00:08:05.430 --> 00:08:09.170
- [LORRAINE] Ed, she's
related to Mary Towne Eastey.

00:08:09.170 --> 00:08:11.390
She's one of the women accused
of witchcraft in Salem.

00:08:11.390 --> 00:08:12.500
She was hung during the trials.

00:08:12.500 --> 00:08:13.727
- Now, I don't know if Mary Towne Eastey

00:08:13.727 --> 00:08:16.700
and Bathsheba Sherman were
actually related in real life,

00:08:16.700 --> 00:08:18.300
but Mary is obviously named

00:08:18.300 --> 00:08:20.890
after another religious
figurehead, the Virgin Mary,

00:08:20.890 --> 00:08:22.560
and Bathsheba's father, Ephraim,

00:08:22.560 --> 00:08:24.270
is probably named for Ephraim,

00:08:24.270 --> 00:08:25.680
the son of Joseph in the Torah.

00:08:25.680 --> 00:08:27.760
It may not have been the
intention of the filmmakers

00:08:27.760 --> 00:08:28.810
to call attention to this,

00:08:28.810 --> 00:08:30.149
but I find it interesting, nonetheless.

00:08:30.149 --> 00:08:31.410
And one more thing,

00:08:31.410 --> 00:08:33.690
if Bathsheba was named
after the biblical Bathsheba

00:08:33.690 --> 00:08:35.080
that's also significant,

00:08:35.080 --> 00:08:36.330
because the biblical Bathsheba

00:08:36.330 --> 00:08:38.450
was also the father of King Solomon.

00:08:38.450 --> 00:08:41.450
Yes, the same King Solomon
from The Lesser Key of Solomon,

00:08:41.450 --> 00:08:43.450
the demonic spell book,
that was the source of lore

00:08:43.450 --> 00:08:45.650
for The Conjuring 2 and
the Annabelle spinoffs.

00:08:45.650 --> 00:08:47.530
The last incident to
occur on the second night

00:08:47.530 --> 00:08:49.470
involves Cindy, the second youngest girl,

00:08:49.470 --> 00:08:51.923
sleepwalking into the
wardrobe in Andrea's room.

00:08:54.030 --> 00:08:56.050
- I've never seen her do this before.

00:08:56.050 --> 00:08:58.700
- A lot of Bath's activity
is related to this wardrobe,

00:08:58.700 --> 00:09:00.450
which the family found
there upon moving in.

00:09:00.450 --> 00:09:01.540
The wardrobe is positioned

00:09:01.540 --> 00:09:03.320
in front of a secret nook behind the wall

00:09:03.320 --> 00:09:04.960
where Rory Walker liked to hide

00:09:04.960 --> 00:09:06.650
when the hauntings got too scary.

00:09:06.650 --> 00:09:09.050
The area also features a
passage down to the cellar,

00:09:09.050 --> 00:09:10.900
which may have been
used for another hanging

00:09:10.900 --> 00:09:12.480
at some point in the house's history,

00:09:12.480 --> 00:09:14.500
though we don't have
any other details on it.

00:09:14.500 --> 00:09:17.000
We see Bathsheba use the
wardrobe again the next day

00:09:17.000 --> 00:09:18.620
when Carolyn is playing hide and clap

00:09:18.620 --> 00:09:19.860
with the youngest daughter, April,

00:09:19.860 --> 00:09:21.670
and Bathsheba's hands emerge from it

00:09:21.670 --> 00:09:23.580
and mislead Carolyn
towards that direction,

00:09:23.580 --> 00:09:25.760
probably hoping to abduct or attack her.

00:09:25.760 --> 00:09:26.750
It's also on this day,

00:09:26.750 --> 00:09:28.410
when birds start crashing into the house,

00:09:28.410 --> 00:09:29.243
which might just be

00:09:29.243 --> 00:09:30.880
another generally creepy thing to happen,

00:09:30.880 --> 00:09:31.850
or might, once again,

00:09:31.850 --> 00:09:34.580
be symbolic Bathsheba's
anti-religious tirade,

00:09:34.580 --> 00:09:36.840
since birds are often
used as Christian symbols,

00:09:36.840 --> 00:09:38.690
like how many churches use dove symbols

00:09:38.690 --> 00:09:40.430
as a connection to the holy spirit.

00:09:40.430 --> 00:09:42.250
The third night features
more ankle pulling.

00:09:42.250 --> 00:09:43.730
Christine is nearly yanked out of bed

00:09:43.730 --> 00:09:46.020
and sees Bathsheba
standing behind her door.

00:09:46.020 --> 00:09:48.070
But her sister Nancy is unable to see it.

00:09:50.112 --> 00:09:52.612
- [Christine] There's
someone standing over there.

00:09:53.590 --> 00:09:55.442
- [Nancy] I don't see anyone.

00:09:55.442 --> 00:09:57.950
- [Christine] It's looking right at us.

00:09:57.950 --> 00:09:59.811
- Nancy is able to smell the putrid scent

00:09:59.811 --> 00:10:01.420
associated with the witch though.

00:10:01.420 --> 00:10:04.390
Yeah, I'm beginning to think
that Bath was a bad nickname.

00:10:04.390 --> 00:10:05.880
It slams the door shut on them

00:10:05.880 --> 00:10:08.000
causing late night calamity in the house.

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:10.560
Roger is gone on a job for the
next week, over which time,

00:10:10.560 --> 00:10:12.620
Bathsheba inflicts more
bruises on Carolyn,

00:10:12.620 --> 00:10:14.650
leads her around the house
at night using sounds,

00:10:14.650 --> 00:10:16.310
knocks the family pictures off the wall,

00:10:16.310 --> 00:10:18.110
which again, were insulting to Bathsheba

00:10:18.110 --> 00:10:20.240
because she's jealous of
Carolyn being the mother figure

00:10:20.240 --> 00:10:22.080
and eventually slammed
the cellar door shut

00:10:22.080 --> 00:10:24.240
in a way that knocks Carolyn
down into the basement

00:10:24.240 --> 00:10:25.920
where more horror ensues.

00:10:25.920 --> 00:10:28.050
Upstairs, Cindy has another
sleepwalking incident,

00:10:28.050 --> 00:10:29.780
but this is probably
just the ghost of Rory

00:10:29.780 --> 00:10:30.720
trying to protect her.

00:10:30.720 --> 00:10:31.553
But in this case,

00:10:31.553 --> 00:10:34.290
the dark presence of Bathsheba
has a counter-attack.

00:10:34.290 --> 00:10:36.160
Andrea is lured back to the wardrobe

00:10:36.160 --> 00:10:38.293
when the knocking sound continues.

00:10:39.445 --> 00:10:42.780
(knocking sounds)

00:10:42.780 --> 00:10:44.750
And Cindy awakens to see a sight

00:10:44.750 --> 00:10:47.363
that no child could ever forget.

00:10:54.592 --> 00:10:55.867
(Bathsheba snarling)

00:10:55.867 --> 00:10:58.450
(girl screams)

00:11:02.687 --> 00:11:05.354
(ominous music)

00:11:06.620 --> 00:11:08.100
After more nights of turmoil,

00:11:08.100 --> 00:11:09.540
Carolyn and Roger enlist the help

00:11:09.540 --> 00:11:11.270
of renowned paranormal investigators,

00:11:11.270 --> 00:11:14.070
Ed and Lorraine Warren,
on November 1st, 1971.

00:11:14.070 --> 00:11:15.690
And when Lorraine sees the dark presence

00:11:15.690 --> 00:11:16.700
latched onto the family,

00:11:16.700 --> 00:11:18.640
Bathsheba immediately sees her as a threat

00:11:18.640 --> 00:11:20.850
and begins plotting, to
how she can ward them off.

00:11:20.850 --> 00:11:22.060
She latches onto Lorraine,

00:11:22.060 --> 00:11:23.370
essentially following her home

00:11:23.370 --> 00:11:24.690
to see what's important to her.

00:11:24.690 --> 00:11:26.440
She witnesses her receiving this locket

00:11:26.440 --> 00:11:27.490
from her daughter, Judy.

00:11:27.490 --> 00:11:28.323
The next night,

00:11:28.323 --> 00:11:29.480
when the Warrens returned to the estate

00:11:29.480 --> 00:11:31.120
Ed places holy items around the house

00:11:31.120 --> 00:11:33.050
to try to draw a reaction
out of the spirits.

00:11:33.050 --> 00:11:35.810
There is some activity
at 9:18 PM in the cellar

00:11:35.810 --> 00:11:37.720
and after they investigate
it and find nothing,

00:11:37.720 --> 00:11:39.900
Bathsheba tries to slam
the door on Carolyn,

00:11:39.900 --> 00:11:41.470
but she's able to jump out of the way.

00:11:41.470 --> 00:11:43.307
The relentless attacks are
really starting to get to her,

00:11:43.307 --> 00:11:46.100
which I imagine is just
what Bathsheba planned for.

00:11:46.100 --> 00:11:47.940
- [CAROLYN] Uh, I'm exhausted.

00:11:47.940 --> 00:11:49.010
I'm just gonna take a nap.

00:11:49.010 --> 00:11:51.050
The late nights, they are getting to me.

00:11:51.050 --> 00:11:52.585
- [ZAC] This leaves her
alone and vulnerable.

00:11:52.585 --> 00:11:54.750
While Lorraine is outside
helping with the laundry

00:11:54.750 --> 00:11:56.230
and the two make eye contact

00:11:56.230 --> 00:11:58.330
before Bathsheba attacks
Carolyn in her sleep

00:11:58.330 --> 00:12:00.780
and possesses her body
by puking in her mouth.

00:12:00.780 --> 00:12:02.060
Yeah, if you're not familiar,

00:12:02.060 --> 00:12:04.190
that's pretty much always
how possession is done

00:12:04.190 --> 00:12:05.380
in The Conjuring movies.

00:12:05.380 --> 00:12:06.570
When Lorraine makes it upstairs,

00:12:06.570 --> 00:12:07.830
Carolyn acts like she's fine.

00:12:07.830 --> 00:12:09.960
So this must be Bathsheba manipulating her

00:12:09.960 --> 00:12:11.480
and trying to hide from Lorraine.

00:12:11.480 --> 00:12:13.700
That night, there's another
sleepwalking incident,

00:12:13.700 --> 00:12:16.230
but this time Lorraine finds
the area behind the wardrobe,

00:12:16.230 --> 00:12:18.220
eventually falling down
into the basement cellar.

00:12:18.220 --> 00:12:19.420
But as she tries to escape,

00:12:19.420 --> 00:12:21.280
she too is attacked by Bathsheba.

00:12:21.280 --> 00:12:22.860
Which if you think about it makes sense.

00:12:22.860 --> 00:12:24.520
Not only is she trying to help the family,

00:12:24.520 --> 00:12:27.060
but she's also taken on a
supportive motherly role.

00:12:27.060 --> 00:12:29.020
For example, she was
helping out with laundry

00:12:29.020 --> 00:12:30.820
while Carolyn was trying to rest.

00:12:30.820 --> 00:12:32.420
Bathsheba goes for her locket,

00:12:32.420 --> 00:12:33.730
the one given to her by Judy,

00:12:33.730 --> 00:12:35.730
the symbol of their
mother-daughter relationship,

00:12:35.730 --> 00:12:37.970
and basically a threat
about who she'll go after

00:12:37.970 --> 00:12:39.710
if Lorraine and Ed don't back off.

00:12:39.710 --> 00:12:41.580
It's here that Bath really ups the ante,

00:12:41.580 --> 00:12:43.050
all the objects turn face down,

00:12:43.050 --> 00:12:45.426
and of course the air yeeting ensues.

00:12:45.426 --> 00:12:48.220
(woman screeching)

00:12:48.220 --> 00:12:49.950
The next day, she issues another warning

00:12:49.950 --> 00:12:51.590
by showing Lorraine a
vision of her daughter

00:12:51.590 --> 00:12:53.130
floating motionless in the river,

00:12:53.130 --> 00:12:54.600
but since they refuse to back off,

00:12:54.600 --> 00:12:57.150
Bathsheba decides to make
this more than just a threat.

00:12:57.150 --> 00:12:58.870
Like Christine at the Old Arnold Estate,

00:12:58.870 --> 00:13:01.840
Judy is also woken up by
ghostly pulling at her ankle.

00:13:01.840 --> 00:13:02.810
She gets up and discovers

00:13:02.810 --> 00:13:04.320
that Bathsheba has actually freed

00:13:04.320 --> 00:13:06.000
the cursed Annabelle doll from its case,

00:13:06.000 --> 00:13:08.650
and finds the benevolent witch
rocking with it in a chair.

00:13:08.650 --> 00:13:10.380
This is the biggest threat yet,

00:13:10.380 --> 00:13:12.940
because Bathsheba is not only
threatening Judy's safety,

00:13:12.940 --> 00:13:15.700
but also potentially freeing
another powerful entity,

00:13:15.700 --> 00:13:17.270
Malthus, who is bound to that doll,

00:13:17.270 --> 00:13:19.500
which is usually sealed inside this case.

00:13:19.500 --> 00:13:21.210
Nothing more would come
of this relationship

00:13:21.210 --> 00:13:22.560
for almost another year though,

00:13:22.560 --> 00:13:24.760
as Judy's parents got home
just in time to save her

00:13:24.760 --> 00:13:27.460
and Annabelle is mysteriously
returned to her case.

00:13:27.460 --> 00:13:28.670
However, that same night,

00:13:28.670 --> 00:13:31.410
the evil tries to sacrifice
another child in Satan's name

00:13:31.410 --> 00:13:32.710
by using the possessed Carolyn

00:13:32.710 --> 00:13:34.160
to kidnap Christine and April.

00:13:34.160 --> 00:13:34.993
Well, I mean,

00:13:34.993 --> 00:13:36.330
I guess you can't really
kidnap your own child,

00:13:36.330 --> 00:13:38.460
but then again, Carolyn
wasn't the one in control.

00:13:38.460 --> 00:13:41.430
Anyway, her plan was to have
the mother sacrifice the child,

00:13:41.430 --> 00:13:44.493
just as she had with her own
child over 100 years before.

00:13:46.360 --> 00:13:47.660
- [CHRISTINE] Where are we going, Mom?

00:13:49.200 --> 00:13:51.250
- On a fantastic trip to The Bahamas!

00:13:51.250 --> 00:13:53.080
- No, they actually go
back to the haunted house,

00:13:53.080 --> 00:13:54.030
believe it or not.

00:13:54.030 --> 00:13:56.560
Once he got home, Drew must
have noticed something was wrong

00:13:56.560 --> 00:13:57.580
and tried to stop her.

00:13:57.580 --> 00:13:58.990
She took the kids down to the cellar

00:13:58.990 --> 00:14:01.210
and tried to stab Christine
with a pair of scissors.

00:14:01.210 --> 00:14:02.380
Drew was able to hold her off,

00:14:02.380 --> 00:14:04.850
and when Ed and Officer Brad
Hamilton show up to the scene,

00:14:04.850 --> 00:14:06.880
it takes all three men
to wrestle the scissors

00:14:06.880 --> 00:14:07.860
out of her hands.

00:14:07.860 --> 00:14:09.210
They try to carry her out of the house

00:14:09.210 --> 00:14:10.120
and get her to a church,

00:14:10.120 --> 00:14:12.630
but this causes bruises to
appear all over her body,

00:14:12.630 --> 00:14:14.690
as they have been since
they first arrived there.

00:14:14.690 --> 00:14:17.620
But also, her skin sears as
they try to leave the house,

00:14:17.620 --> 00:14:18.982
- She won't let her leave the house.

00:14:18.982 --> 00:14:19.815
- What do you mean?

00:14:19.815 --> 00:14:21.120
- If we take her out,
the witch will kill her

00:14:21.120 --> 00:14:22.410
- They ended up tying her to a chair

00:14:22.410 --> 00:14:23.560
to perform the exorcism,

00:14:23.560 --> 00:14:25.580
and this causes the entire house to shake

00:14:25.580 --> 00:14:27.770
and birds to crash in from all directions.

00:14:27.770 --> 00:14:29.880
When Ed commands Bathsheba
to reveal herself,

00:14:29.880 --> 00:14:31.610
it is her face that
pokes through the sheets

00:14:31.610 --> 00:14:32.800
rather than Carolyn's.

00:14:32.800 --> 00:14:34.650
She levitates off the ground, inverts,

00:14:34.650 --> 00:14:36.090
and tries to bust through the ceiling,

00:14:36.090 --> 00:14:38.330
laughing hysterically at
their attempts to stop her,

00:14:38.330 --> 00:14:40.300
claiming that Carolyn is already gone.

00:14:40.300 --> 00:14:41.870
She breaks free and goes after April

00:14:41.870 --> 00:14:42.703
with a pair of scissors.

00:14:42.703 --> 00:14:44.320
So Ed, in one last ditch effort,

00:14:44.320 --> 00:14:45.710
calls Bathsheba out by name,

00:14:45.710 --> 00:14:47.500
and attempts to condemn her back to hell.

00:14:47.500 --> 00:14:49.420
However, I don't think it was this alone

00:14:49.420 --> 00:14:50.700
that managed to stop her.

00:14:50.700 --> 00:14:51.970
Even though she had been possessed,

00:14:51.970 --> 00:14:54.520
the real Carolyn was still
down in there somewhere.

00:14:54.520 --> 00:14:55.930
She recalls a memory of the day

00:14:55.930 --> 00:14:58.080
that she and Roger went to
the beach with their children

00:14:58.080 --> 00:15:01.100
and is able to use that love
to push back against Bathsheba.

00:15:01.100 --> 00:15:02.900
In the end, it was her love for family

00:15:02.900 --> 00:15:04.080
that helped her overcome a witch

00:15:04.080 --> 00:15:06.620
who used her own family as
a sacrifice to the devil.

00:15:06.620 --> 00:15:09.470
And she's able to spit back
out the toxic part of Bathsheba

00:15:09.470 --> 00:15:10.680
that resided within her.

00:15:10.680 --> 00:15:11.550
That is the last

00:15:11.550 --> 00:15:13.890
that the Perron family
saw of Bathsheba Sherman,

00:15:13.890 --> 00:15:15.100
but that does not mean

00:15:15.100 --> 00:15:17.190
that this entity's
story is over quite yet.

00:15:17.190 --> 00:15:20.510
The spirit was caught in the
childrens' music box (somehow)

00:15:20.510 --> 00:15:22.860
and taken back home with the
Warrens to be sealed away

00:15:22.860 --> 00:15:24.970
in their cursed artifact
museum for safety,

00:15:24.970 --> 00:15:27.650
which all worked out just
fine for almost a year.

00:15:27.650 --> 00:15:29.470
It was September of 1972

00:15:29.470 --> 00:15:30.950
when the Warrens were away on a case,

00:15:30.950 --> 00:15:32.380
and hired a babysitter for Judy.

00:15:32.380 --> 00:15:33.500
The babysitter has a friend over

00:15:33.500 --> 00:15:34.930
to help celebrate Judy's birthday,

00:15:34.930 --> 00:15:36.680
and the friend accidentally sets free

00:15:36.680 --> 00:15:38.150
Malthus, the Annabelle demon,

00:15:38.150 --> 00:15:40.080
who, as we saw with Judy in November,

00:15:40.080 --> 00:15:42.090
happens to be a beacon for other spirits.

00:15:42.090 --> 00:15:44.250
And the house is overrun
by many of the ghosts

00:15:44.250 --> 00:15:46.410
that Ed and Lorraine had
locked up over the years.

00:15:46.410 --> 00:15:48.210
Now we don't specifically see Bathsheba

00:15:48.210 --> 00:15:50.080
take on a visible form during this chaos,

00:15:50.080 --> 00:15:51.910
but we do see this.

00:15:51.910 --> 00:15:52.743
Roll it.

00:16:04.330 --> 00:16:06.140
Judy is pulled out of bed by the ankle

00:16:06.140 --> 00:16:08.170
just as her and Christine Perron had been

00:16:08.170 --> 00:16:09.920
by Bathsheba the prior year.

00:16:09.920 --> 00:16:12.410
Could this be an example
of Malthus and Bathsheba

00:16:12.410 --> 00:16:13.570
teaming up against Judy

00:16:13.570 --> 00:16:15.100
just as they had in The Conjuring,

00:16:15.100 --> 00:16:16.650
or is this simply a case of Malthus

00:16:16.650 --> 00:16:17.890
having learned from Bathsheba

00:16:17.890 --> 00:16:20.820
and deciding to take Judy's
ankle into its own hand?

00:16:20.820 --> 00:16:21.900
Either way, it seems like

00:16:21.900 --> 00:16:24.130
old Bath will never quite
be done causing trouble

00:16:24.130 --> 00:16:25.120
in the human world,

00:16:25.120 --> 00:16:27.220
whether she materializes in it or not.

00:16:27.220 --> 00:16:28.053
While we only have

00:16:28.053 --> 00:16:29.580
these two brief interactions between them,

00:16:29.580 --> 00:16:31.770
there is a lot more to learn about Malthus

00:16:31.770 --> 00:16:33.970
and what makes it one of
the most powerful entities

00:16:33.970 --> 00:16:35.130
in the Conjurverse lore.

00:16:35.130 --> 00:16:36.680
So click that video on the left

00:16:36.680 --> 00:16:39.370
to see me analyze the
entire history of Malthus

00:16:39.370 --> 00:16:41.110
and let me know what other
Conjurverse characters

00:16:41.110 --> 00:16:42.970
you'd like to see covered
here on Horror History.

00:16:42.970 --> 00:16:44.850
Remember to subscribe to CZsWorld

00:16:44.850 --> 00:16:46.270
for new horrors every week,

00:16:46.270 --> 00:16:48.410
ring the death bell for all notifications,

00:16:48.410 --> 00:16:50.320
and I'll see you in the next one,

00:16:50.320 --> 00:16:52.280
assuming we both survive

00:16:52.280 --> 00:16:54.680
and you can start by
getting that COVID vaccine.

